    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Graham Edgar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109826184711933732826/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVQabiji2-qZGmzfsiyGR8ycVA-G2BF6DuFbnRp6pMFI6QWq6i5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "What a lifesaver. Driving to NB we have no credit card and were welcomed and given a room with very big smile and fast courteous service. Very quiet and clean, fantastic bead a huge fridge to keep our food and a microwave to warm our coffee. Couldnt get any better. Highly recommended",
        "time": 1691336113,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mohamed ALI-RAGE",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107440869087024342191/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKrvoKGArU6bXLvrSxuXVC4QHY1ODAN7-zMzObOOYjfkiS76Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Very nice lady. We showed up there at 1 am. She found us a room and gave us a spot where to park our truck. The AC and TV were old. Really old but the AC worked good and that is what mattered. We never bothered to switch the TV as we were there to sleep. Would go back there anytime I end up in Montreal area.",
        "time": 1626945824,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Booyaka Stubbs (ExplorewithStubbs.com)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104469438241489240098/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCNL7GozDQI-VJWsftOwbr8gRIId3XqTmLF9qYqxuDIAT3f-Yl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "A nice little motel situated in the city near some local things like a strip plaza with a couple of options for eating. There is a movie theater in the same plaza. Gas station basically right next door. McDonald's is just a hop skip and jump away as well. As for the motel itself, it was very reasonably priced and was very comfortable. Had A/C which was nice as it was hot during the St. John Baptiste holiday. The room had 2 double beds a microwave and refrigerator. A nuce shower to relax and unwind..A television that we didn't look at so I have no idea if they have English language shows. Pierre was the man at the desk that night when we arrived and he was very nice and friendly. Very polite too, asked if we needed help with anything. There is an outdoor grilling area too, not too sure what the procedure is to use it but I'm sure it's there for the guests...I'd come back for sure",
        "time": 1530277006,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vanessa Downs",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113703630676446393269/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKRCACctrW0T4avJ6RH4VL4KpHccwHeGcq0MduPZNJPHZTRMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Great motel! The staff is kind and friendly. The price is very affordable and close to the city. Lots of food options near by. The rooms were very clean & felt welcoming. Highly recommend it!:)",
        "time": 1689552724,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Fae Jabberi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106633714199388764838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6yzbeB-hxebut5UZ3JP14YQThKDnoAOWWPwMhM6BV7ogIq6Kwgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "If i could give this place 0 stars i would. Firstly the ac took all night to get to 64 degrees farinhight while it started at 90 degrees. The ac barely worked in general. Secondly the whole thing was overpriced. We paid 100 dollars for the motel and it was not worth it. There is no wifi, breakfast, and the tv looked like it was stuck in the early 2000s and barely worked. Now worst of all the owner had a terrible attitude. We asked her to check out our ac to make sure it wasn't broken and she said, \"No its working it is just hot outside.\" We responding saying that its colder outside, which is totally true, then she responded \"Then go sleep outside.\" The whole time she was just giving us a hard time for everything. After she checked out our ac she went and talked about us with other guests. All in all don't stay here at any costs.",
        "time": 1530903315,
        "translated": false
      }
